{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#card-zh","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 是面向 DSH 的模型路由控制插件，包含 DSH 工具和独立命令行探针。它注册工具以查看当前默认模型、已登记的 provider 路由及可选模型目录，并可校验精确的 provider/model 后保存为新会话默认值；命令行则探测兼容接口的 /models 端点，呈现可达状态、延迟、模型数和凭据配置情况。适合需要管理多个模型路由或快速检查端点连通性的 DSH 用户。探测端点可从本地 JSON 配置，示例凭据变量 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 为可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-123","bin/dsh-switch.mjs:29-58","lib/probe.mjs:55-117","providers.example.json:1-16"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#card-en","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-switch helps DSH users manage model routes. Its tools show registered providers and defaults, validate a provider/model, and set the default for new sessions. Its CLI checks compatible /models endpoints for reachability, latency, and model count. Probe targets use local JSON configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-123","bin/dsh-switch.mjs:29-58","lib/probe.mjs:55-117","providers.example.json:1-16"]}
