{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#feature-status","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 的功能「模型路由状态」：查看当前默认模型和已注册 provider 路由；可选读取各 adapter 公布的模型目录，并汇总目录读取错误。通过 DSH 工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-53"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#feature-default","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 的功能「设置默认模型」：校验指定 provider 与模型路由及可选推理强度，再保存并回读确认；只影响新会话。可用 expected 参数拒绝过期状态下的写入。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:55-114"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#feature-probe","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 的功能「探测端点」：命令行向配置的兼容模型端点发送 /models 请求，输出可达状态、HTTP 状态、耗时、模型数和凭据是否配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-switch.mjs:29-45"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#feature-choose","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 的功能「选择低延迟服务」：探测配置中的多个 provider，筛出健康端点后按延迟排序，并输出最低延迟的 provider 标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/probe.mjs:108-117"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#feature-validate","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 的功能「检查探针配置」：校验 provider 标识、绝对 HTTP(S) 地址、可选环境变量名、模型路径和超时范围；通过命令行 validate 检查本地 JSON 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/probe.mjs:6-53"]}
