{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-switch#caveat-probe-scope","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","commit":"029cd1ac8dc9befeac3f26ea0e10f76c4dd576bf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-switch 使用前须知：端点探测只请求配置的 /models 路径，检查可达性和目录信息，不代表已经验证模型生成能力。（见 lib/probe.mjs:55-90）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/probe.mjs:55-90"]}
